  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Accelerating Climate Resilient Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Services for All Schools and Health Care Facilities in Karamoja Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to improved health and educational outcomes for children by enhancing access to and utilization of safe drinking water in all primary and secondary schools and healthcare facilities in the Karamoja region of Uganda, as well as by improving the supply of safe water and promoting public and personal hygiene&#xc6b0;&#xac04;&#xb2e4; &#xce74;&#xb77c;&#xbaa8;&#xc790; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xd559;&#xad50; &#xbc0f; &#xbcf4;&#xac74;&#xc758;&#xb8cc;&#xc2dc;&#xc124;&#xc758; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xb300;&#xc751;&#xc744; &#xace0;&#xb824;&#xd55c; &#xae30;&#xbcf8;&#xc801; &#xc218;&#xc900;&#xc758; &#xbb3c;&#xacfc; &#xc704;&#xc0dd;(WASH) &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xc774;&#xc6a9; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of integrated water, sanitation, hygiene (WASH) facilities within schools, capacity building for stakeholders in water and sanitation, and support for policy initiatives to address climate change</narrative>
  </description>
